OL,3,GNEWSAFire that killed mum and three
OL,4,Achildren caused by lithium-ion battery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fatal house fire that killed a mother
OL,7,Fand her three children was caused by a
OL,8,Flithium-ion battery, the fire service
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FElisha Brabin, 36, and her children,
OL,12,FLeo, 16, Ellis, 8, and Prudence, 7,
OL,13,Fdied after a blaze "spread rapidly"
OL,14,Finside a house on Stone Square in
OL,15,FBootle, Merseyside, in the early hours
OL,16,Fof 22 September.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
