OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFire that killed mum and three
OL,4,Achildren caused by lithium-ion battery
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing an investigation with
OL,7,FMerseyside Police, Merseyside Fire and
OL,8,FRescue Service (MFRS) said the fire was
OL,9,Fcaused by an electrical event linked to
OL,10,Fa lithium-ion battery, which are used
OL,11,Fin e-bikes and e-scooters.
OL,13,FMFRS said: "This tragedy highlights the
OL,14,Fvery real risks posed by lithium-ion
OL,15,Fbatteries, which we confirmed as the
OL,16,Fsource of the fire."
